---
alwaysApply: false
---

colors:
primary: "#F11B0C"
secondary: "#202020"
body: "#1A1A1A"
shadow: "#9A9A9A"
shadow-light: "#C2C2C2"
background: "#FFFFFF"

usage:

- Red (#F11B0C): Titles, emphasis, underlines
- Dark Gray (#202020): Subheadings, dividers, borders
- Body Gray (#1A1A1A): Paragraph text
- Shadow Grays (#9A9A9A / #C2C2C2): Depth and spacing definition
